g the derivatives of $x$ and $y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t))=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t))=3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute these derivatives in the formula for arc length, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t))^{2}+(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t))^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{4{cos}^{2}⁡(2t)+9{cos}^{2}⁡(3t)}\\,\\text{d}t\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039829/state.json" "file_sha256" "2e0226043fed6ba0104c5d1ce045f228d357296f9c74a07382d19d96cfe7c2e5"} {"question" "q-21347" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039829/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fca83d133dfbce94c6d6fb8122c09b1e7028fadefab673818953b0808b76345f"} {"question" "q-21347" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039829/state.json" "file_sha256" "2e0226043fed6ba0104c5d1ce045f228d357296f9c74a07382d19d96cfe7c2e5"} {"question" "q-21347" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{16{cos}^{2}⁡(2t)+9{cos}^{2}⁡(3t)}\\,\\text{d}t"] ["math" "{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\sqrt{2{cos}^{2}⁡(2t)+3{cos}^{2}